Z||000000||Tigger||07-07-2001||11:26 PM||||What a night!  Dale Jr dominates most of the race and after a caution and makes the last pit stop comes back from about 8th in the last laps to win!<P>Michael Waltrip takes second place, he restarted from 14th on the last restart.  <P>Wow, Dale Jr. had the strongest car in the field and held everyone off even when they tried to gang up on him.  People will speculate, but this was a good race, couldn't have asked for a better finish!||||reg||14
